    "description": "Aruni Shapiro introduces Adam Smith to Sri Lanka\u2019s readers",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Aruni-Shapiro-introduces-Adam-Smith-to-Sri-Lanka-s-readers/4-782633",
