    "chunk_size_bytes": 1424,
    "chunk_text": "AAC Official Sponsor of Colombo Motor Show 2025\n\nA media conference for the forthcoming Colombo Motor Show 2025 to be held from 21st to 23rd November 2025 was held at Galadari Ballroom on September 30, organized by Asia Exhibition & Convention (Pvt) Ltd.\n\nColombo Motor show 2025 is being conducted for the 19th consecutive year.\n\nThe Automobile Association of Ceylon (AAC), oldest and largest motoring organization in Sri Lanka, was recognized as the Official Sponsor and will be the Official Motoring Club. The Association had been associated with the Motor Show from the inception.\n\nThe Automobile Association of Ceylon initiated the investment and Devapriya Hettiarachchi \u2013 Secretary, AAC handed over a cheque for Rs. 500,000.00 at the media conference to the organizers.\n\nThe organizers gave a brief account on the arrangements for the event and the prospective participants and stakeholders who would display their merchandise and motor vehicles.\n\nDevapriya Hettiarachchi, Secretary (AAC) (second from right) handing over the sponsorship cheque to Tyronne Chandrasena , Managing Director of Asia Exhibition & Convention (Pvt) Ltd.\n\nPrices realized by Ceylon Tea at Osaka charity auction enter \u2018Guinness Book of Records\u2019\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
