    "date_str": "2025-10-08",
    "description": "Licence for indiscipline? Perils of Sri Lanka\u2019s new child rights agenda",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Licence-for-indiscipline-Perils-of-Sri-Lanka-s-new-child-rights-agenda/4-782702",
