    "chunk_text": "CSE to conduct a full day of trading from Disaster Recovery site\n\nThe Colombo Stock Exchange (CSE) is to conduct a planned full day of trading from the Disaster Recovery site using Automated Trading System Disaster Recovery Solution on Friday, 10th October 2025.\n\nThe exercise will be an industry wide activity with the participation of all stakeholders, to ensure the preparedness of all participants to meet the recovery needs of the industry.\n\nSumathi IT introduces Sri Lanka\u2019s first DJI Dock 3 to boost public safety\n\nOmega Line triumphs at CPM Sri Lanka Management Leadership Excellence Awards 2025\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
