    "chunk_text": "Lanka Graphite Ltd., Chairman P.V.A. Hemalal, who participated in the event, had previously remitted Rs. 7.4 million to the Treasury. Significantly, this marks the first time in 14 years that Lanka Graphite has paid funds to the Treasury.\n\nIndustries and Enterprise Development Minister Sunil Handunneththi, Deputy Minister Chathuranga Abeysinghe, Ministry Secretary Thilaka Jayasundara, and other officials were also present at the occasion."
