    "description": "Sri Lanka indirectly linked to Iran\u2019s \u2018shadow fleet\u2019 oil and LPG network hit by new US sanctions",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Sri-Lanka-indirectly-linked-to-Iran-s-shadow-fleet-oil-and-LPG-network-hit-by-new-US-sanctions/56-782823",
