    "md5": "92c5cf55d5fd83a37e31ea0f4b0ed1bf",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1242,
    "chunk_text": "DSI Tyres\u2019 e-commerce wins four awards at SLIM DIGIS 2.5\n\nSri Lanka\u2019s pioneering tyre e-commerce platform, dsityreshop.com, backed by the trusted strength of DSI Tyres, was honored with four awards at the prestigious SLIM DIGIS 2.5 Awards. These recognitions spotlight the platform\u2019s innovative Pick-Up from Dealer model and data-driven, performance-focused campaigns.\n\nAt SLIM DIGIS 2.5, dsityreshop.com proudly secured two Category Best Awards (Silver):\n\n\u2022 Best use of Digital in a Marketing Campaign for Automotive\n\nThrough this dual fulfilment system, customers can purchase genuine DSI Tyres and Hankook tyres online, with the choice of secure home delivery or pick-up from dealer via DSI Tyres\u2019 trusted dealer network.\n\nCommenting on this success, Kavinda Rajapaksa, Managing Director of Samson Rubber Industries, said:\n\n\u201cWe are proud to see dsityreshop.com recognized with four awards at SLIM DIGIS 2.5. This achievement reflects our vision of transforming the tyre-buying journey in Sri Lanka through digital-first innovation.\u201d\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
