    "chunk_text": "JF Packaging announces IPO, investor forum\n\nAn acclaimed Sri Lanka\u2019s leading flexible packaging solutions provider, and a multi-award-winning innovator in the industry, JF Packaging Limited intends to officially announce its Initial Public Offering of Ordinary Voting Shares.\n\nThe Investor Forum has been scheduled for the 21st October 2025, to provide potential investors with an in-depth understanding of the company\u2019s operations, business model, and future growth plans. Investors from across the globe are invited to join the forum via an online video stream, offering a unique opportunity to engage directly with the company\u2019s leadership. The company encourages interested parties to join the forum and gain valuable insights into this compelling investment opportunity.\n\nGABV Asia-Pacific Chapter meeting 2025 to be held in Colombo\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
