    "description": "eChannelling launches eMindCare as holistic digital platform for mental wellbeing",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/eChannelling-launches-eMindCare-as-holistic-digital-platform-for-mental-wellbeing/34-783001",
