    "description": "Hand in hand for better foods and a better future: Partnerships for Sri Lanka\u2019s SDG journey",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Hand-in-hand-for-better-foods-and-a-better-future-Partnerships-for-Sri-Lanka-s-SDG-journey/4-783042",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
