    "description": "Promise and peril of relativism: Respecting perspectives without excusing injustice",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Promise-and-peril-of-relativism-Respecting-perspectives-without-excusing-injustice/4-783044",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
