    "description": "CPC chief answers United Petroleum: \u2018We\u2019ve honoured every condition under exit agreement\u2019",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/cpc-chief-answers-united-petroleum-weve-honoured-every-condition-under-exit-agreement/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
