    "description": "Another health \u2018bill\u2019 for the consumer to foot?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Another-health-bill-for-the-consumer-to-foot/4-783109",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
