    "md5": "4b98a7bd292690a28900d7f43b9cc7a6",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1899,
    "chunk_text": "Lanka Aluminium boosts retail sector with credit terms and credit card offerings\n\nLanka Aluminium Industries PLC, Sri Lanka\u2019s pioneering aluminium extruder, is transforming the retail aluminium extrusion supplies market by offering credit terms as well as credit card payment facilities at the company\u2019s retail outlets that are being established island-wide.\n\n\u201cWe have observed a growing demand for the more generic architectural and hardware sections, which are usually sold in retail outlets. In order to capitalise on this opportunity, we are offering credit terms and credit card payment facilities to selected customers through our retail network,\u201d said Dinal Peiris \u2013 Chairman, Lanka Aluminium Industries PLC.\n\nLanka Aluminium has provided its architectural aluminium extrusion solutions to some of the most prestigious and iconic buildings in the country, including those that meet international standards. The company continues to assist clients by providing tech support, wind load calculations, and assembly drawings.\n\nIn the absence of growth in the high-rise segment, the company has decided to focus on the retail segment.\n\n\u201cWe plan to use our strong technical skills and large selection of doors and windows to assist customers, especially home builders, to select the most appropriate product and not necessarily the most expensive one,\u201d said Susantha Paranagama \u2013 Head of retail.\n\n\u201cThis helps the customer to save money and get the best product, thereby building trust and confidence. We also provide them with shop and assembly drawings and introduce suitable fabricators,\u201d he said.\n\n\u201cWe are confident that offering these services and facilities, free of charge, to our valued customers will enable us to build long-term relationships, thereby increasing the usage of aluminium doors and windows, especially amongst house builders,\u201d said Susantha Paranagama."
  },
