    "chunk_text": "Sun Siyam Pasikudah and Chairman Siyam honoured at Global Hospitality Awards\n\nIn a significant international accolade for Sri Lanka\u2019s tourism sector, the\u00a0Sun Siyam Pasikudah\u00a0resort was awarded \u2018Luxury Beachfront Retreat of the Year\u2019 at the prestigious Global Peace Hospitality Summit & Awards 2025 in Dubai.\n\nThe award recognises the resort\u2019s excellence in \u201cmindful luxury and sustainable tourism,\u201d highlighting Sri Lanka\u2019s growing profile in the global peace-led hospitality market.\n\nThe event also served as a major triumph for the Maldivian-based Sun Siyam Group and its Founder & Chairman,\u00a0Ahmed Siyam Mohamed. Siyam was the ceremony\u2019s most decorated individual, receiving three top honours: the Golden Sail of Distinction and two Lifetime Achievement Awards for Hospitality & Service Excellence and Entrepreneurship & Business Innovation.\n\nThe awards celebrated his pivotal role in developing the Maldives as a world-class destination and his decades of work in national development and philanthropy.\n\nBeyond the Pasikudah win, the Sun Siyam Group\u2019s portfolio was recognised with six major awards, cementing its status as a leader in sustainable luxury. The other winning properties are located in the Maldives and include Siyam World, Sun Siyam Vilu Reef, Sun Siyam Iru Fushi, Sun Siyam Iru Veli, and Sun Siyam Olhuveli.\n\nThe summit, hosted by the Global Peace Institute (UK) under the theme \u201cPeace Through Hospitality,\u201d gathered over 200 leaders from 46 nations. The accolades underscore the Sun Siyam Group\u2019s successful strategy of combining business excellence with sustainability and social progress.\n\nMintpay partners with FitsAir to make outbound travel more accessible\n\nCasons Rent a Car introduces Sri Lanka\u2019s first fleet of eco-friendly vehicles\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave 